From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:40:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] redesign(profile): Instagram-style header, remove
 duplicate top avatar
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- np-identity now mirrors Instagram's profile layout: avatar on the
  left, three stat columns (Treinos/Nível/Ranking) to the right, name
  + PRO badge and bio below, an "Editar perfil" button, then the XP
  bar
- removed the small duplicate avatar+PRO badge from the top header
  (np-head-avatar) since the profile photo now only appears once, in
  the identity block
- updated the one test that asserted the old hexagon level badge
  markup to match the new stat-column layout

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GJxr5k2q4nCkbZphek1rFs
